%% HAND-CURATED. Normalized from spec sequenceDiagram at 16-parent-mobile-application.md#L619 — strips the foreground-toast + deep-link tap subflows. Covers Registration + onTokenRefresh only.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant OS
    participant FCM
    participant Gateway
    participant NotificationService

    ParentApp->>OS: request notification permission (iOS explicit / Android 13+ POST_NOTIFICATIONS)
    alt os_permission_denied
        OS-->>ParentApp: denied
        Note over ParentApp: surface in-app banner — registration skipped, safety alerts still server-enforced
    else permission granted
        OS-->>ParentApp: granted
        ParentApp->>FCM: get device token
        alt fcm_token_unavailable
            FCM-->>ParentApp: error / null token
            Note over ParentApp: schedule retry on next foreground
        else token issued
            FCM-->>ParentApp: fcm_token
            ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/notifications/push-token {token, platform}
            Gateway->>Gateway: rate-limit (sys-17) — push_token — 10 per hour per parent ID
            Gateway->>NotificationService: forward
            alt push_token_rate_limited
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 push_token_rate_limited
            else register_token_failed
                NotificationService-->>Gateway: 5xx
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 5xx — schedule single retry
            else registered
                NotificationService-->>Gateway: 201 Created
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 201
            end
        end
    end

    Note over FCM,NotificationService: onTokenRefresh — FCM rotates token, app re-runs POST /v1/notifications/push-token with new token (idempotent upsert)
